{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/23b9fb9d2ba1cd7faabaebdf777f9b61.avif?t=1760340882\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br>Mystery of Myths: Whisper of Depth Collector's Edition is a hidden-object puzzle adventure where ancient Breton legends rise with the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the misty shores of Quimper, impossible deaths begin to surface: victims found drowned in dry rooms, their homes filled only with salt, seaweed, and silence. Agent Elijah Reed is dispatched to investigate \u2014 and soon uncovers echoes of the drowned city of Ys.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/36e433bfc4d0e3b82054c2e583606368.poster.avif?t=1760340882\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/36e433bfc4d0e3b82054c2e583606368.webm?t=1760340882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/36e433bfc4d0e3b82054c2e583606368.mp4?t=1760340882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the Ministry\u2019s archives, fragments of a legend emerge: Dahut, the princess of the sunken city, whose song can bend tides, pierce worlds, and lure the living into the abyss. The trail leads to a haunted lighthouse, where whispers of the deep grow louder with each step. But who is Dahut really \u2014 monster, memory, or something trapped in between?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/f9d7f2ab95c6a9bf46aad57c92d29b52.poster.avif?t=1760340882\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/f9d7f2ab95c6a9bf46aad57c92d29b52.webm?t=1760340882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/f9d7f2ab95c6a9bf46aad57c92d29b52.mp4?t=1760340882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udd39 Explore atmospheric French landscapes, from mist-shrouded hotels to abandoned lighthouses.<br>\ud83d\udd39 Solve interactive puzzles, hidden-object scenes, and narrative challenges.<br>\ud83d\udd39 Uncover clues using both modern detective methods and occult tools from Elijah\u2019s training.<br>\ud83d\udd39 Piece together the legend of Dahut and prevent the drowned city from rising again.<br>\ud83d\udd39 Immerse yourself in a suspenseful mystery where myth and reality collide beneath the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely: if you hear her voice, it may already be too late\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054310?t=1760340882","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054310?t=1760340882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/8b352be18d59c43b80dbd1b77f054e0f6361763e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760340882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/8b352be18d59c43b80dbd1b77f054e0f6361763e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760340882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/23b9fb9d2ba1cd7faabaebdf777f9b61.avif?t=1760340882\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br>Mystery of Myths: 